{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a unique blend of <strong>rhythm, deck-building, and roguelike mechanics</strong>. Embark on an adventure, unlock and collect various skills, and build your own skill pool to adapt to the ever-changing challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1740470925\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gameplay is inspired by a <strong>classroom clapping game</strong> that was popular in parts of East Asia about twenty years ago. Unlike traditional card-based roguelikes, you won\u2019t have the luxury of time to carefully plan your next move. Instead, you must <strong>adapt to a fast-paced and ever-shifting combat rhythm</strong>, making split-second decisions before each beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/CLAPCLASH2-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1740470925\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What's an adventure without a bit of luck? Gacha-style card draws included!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/CLAPCLASH3-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1740470925\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every adventure is unpredictable\u2014events along the way can shift dynamically. Will you take high risks for greater rewards, or proceed with caution? <strong>Different strategies will lead to different experiences</strong>, making each run a fresh challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I\u2019m an indie game developer, balancing between passion and survival, searching for a way to turn my love for games into something real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you have any questions or feedback, feel free to reach out via email!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3539570?t=1740470925","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3539570?t=1740470925","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/2643850e777702ca691f97eba1ec0a82db3d936e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740470925","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/2643850e777702ca691f97eba1ec0a82db3d936e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740470925","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"The game uses pixel art to depict combat, killing, and bloodshed. Some characters in the game wear revealing outfits."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a unique blend of <strong>rhythm, deck-building, and roguelike mechanics</strong>. Embark on an adventure, unlock and collect various skills, and build your own skill pool to adapt to the ever-changing challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1740470925\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gameplay is inspired by a <strong>classroom clapping game</strong> that was popular in parts of East Asia about twenty years ago. Unlike traditional card-based roguelikes, you won\u2019t have the luxury of time to carefully plan your next move. Instead, you must <strong>adapt to a fast-paced and ever-shifting combat rhythm</strong>, making split-second decisions before each beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/CLAPCLASH2-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1740470925\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What's an adventure without a bit of luck? Gacha-style card draws included!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/CLAPCLASH3-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1740470925\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every adventure is unpredictable\u2014events along the way can shift dynamically. Will you take high risks for greater rewards, or proceed with caution? <strong>Different strategies will lead to different experiences</strong>, making each run a fresh challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I\u2019m an indie game developer, balancing between passion and survival, searching for a way to turn my love for games into something real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you have any questions or feedback, feel free to reach out via email!</p>","developers":["eineLitschi"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/header.jpg?t=1740470925","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257099209,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099209/movie480.mp4?t=1740470428","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099209/movie_max.mp4?t=1740470428"},"name":"Gameplay Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257099209/9dc7d1d2187523c0216516c60cb339d6346289ee/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740470428","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099209/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740470428","max":"http://video.a